{"last_link_id": 32, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [6], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [416.55795247895094, 542.6984143914311], "pos": [757.8966951236405, -279.9238311759028], "widgets_values": ["How the reference pictures align with the target video — Picture 1 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 0.00-second mark of the target video; Picture 2 (from Shot 4) aligns with the 5.00-second mark of the target video.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] 3D CG, cinematic, photorealistic live-action styling with cold-toned moonlight, a medium-wide shot opens on the moonlit confrontation established in Picture 1: the black-robed masked figure with gold trim and a silver mask stands on the left, his eyes glowing faint blue behind the mask, his clawed dark hand thrust forward releasing a torrent of blue shadow-flame, while the young woman in a deep-blue Chinese qipao with a coiled bun stands on the right, pushing her palm forward and unleashing a burst of pure white qi. The two energies collide head-on at the center. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at fast speed as the blue and white forces clash with a sharp sizzle, the shockwave lifting both figures' robes. [Shot 2] At 00:01.000, the shot transitions to a fast pan with large amplitude, tracking the masked figure's blue eyes flaring brighter as he withdraws his hands and seals his palms before his chest, firing a devastating high-energy blue laser beam. The young woman, still in the same blue qipao with the coiled bun from Shot 1, throws her weight backward and slides into a low ground-level dodge, retreating like a fish darting away. [Shot 3] At 00:02.500, the shot cuts to a slow-motion wide shot: the blue death ray sweeps past the young woman's hair and shoulder as her white qi splits into several sharp sword-beams flung from her arm, carving deep trenches into the ground. The shockwave shatters the floor, hurling rubble and dust into the air in a dense particle burst, with slight camera shake and a subtle lens flare glinting across the blue-white glow. [Shot 4] At 00:04.000, the shot cuts to a low-angle static shot as the camera holds, the scene landing precisely on the final frame established by Picture 2 at the end of the video: the young woman skims along the ground with one palm bracing her body and the other arm trailing a sweeping white aura behind her, having barely evaded the lethal beam, while the masked figure holds his firing pose with blue light streaming from his hands. Amid swirling debris and interweaving blue-white light, she lifts her eyes with a cold, calculating gaze, poised to counterattack, freezing on the exact pose, spacing, and composition of Picture 2.\n\noverall_soundscape: A deep low bass rumble opens the confrontation, joined from the second second by a high-frequency electric crackle. The colliding energies give a sharp sizzle, followed by the rustle of fabric during the sliding dodge and the harsh cracking of shattered stone as rubble scatters across the ground.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 1, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 0, "widgets_values_named": {"value": "How the reference pictures align with the target video — Picture 1 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 0.00-second mark of the target video; Picture 2 (from Shot 4) aligns with the 5.00-second mark of the target video.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] 3D CG, cinematic, photorealistic live-action styling with cold-toned moonlight, a medium-wide shot opens on the moonlit confrontation established in Picture 1: the black-robed masked figure with gold trim and a silver mask stands on the left, his eyes glowing faint blue behind the mask, his clawed dark hand thrus